    <briefdescription>
<para>CRC-16, incremental stream parser and frame encoder. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Pure functions over caller-owned buffers: no state outside the structures passed in, safe to use from several contexts on different structures.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Public interface includes:</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>CRC: <ref refid="group__baton__protocol_1gaea4c4ccc6e241cd204b7fb8560e1ef61" kindref="member">baton_crc16</ref>, <ref refid="group__baton__protocol_1gaee18f48e881edb6b3f3c77a5309133f7" kindref="member">baton_crc16_update</ref>. </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para>Parser: <ref refid="group__baton__protocol_1ga88c62f578e7f5ebff0bad72afc6e6d16" kindref="member">baton_parser_init</ref>, <ref refid="group__baton__protocol_1gaecb5b1070c3f177d31da3419c1e784eb" kindref="member">baton_parser_feed</ref>. </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para>Encoder: <ref refid="group__baton__protocol_1ga2bd21ca87b358bbc18150046075c9b7e" kindref="member">baton_encode</ref>. </para>
</listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</para>
</simplesect>
</para>
